    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-a81e4d03-a4d4-44df-b5e1-accc429bd7a7" n="0768" facs="#m-cd864b4a-acb2-4438-a252-be3243845ef6" /><div xml:id="m-9bca0a7b-48a7-45d3-a9c3-fbb415ce12e7">
            <lg xml:id="m-20b4e6e6-9fc8-4635-a6c4-c32f50a6efb6">
              <l xml:id="m-5b265cdb-f4c4-46c9-a220-5a3d4941de8b" facs="#m-d3fac606-6c59-4ab0-b58c-7124c2510e57" label="ambiguous">622</l><l xml:id="m-446ba28e-becb-4388-99d5-35432e773fe6" facs="#m-3b6769fb-4f3d-4b37-ad92-438672091067" label="ambiguous">Wednesday in Holy Week</l><l xml:id="m-d58b84ec-e2a1-423b-9758-fcf2e1af8d40" facs="#m-4e931d51-7bac-41b9-adc4-6941e01c5c72" label="lyrics-like">dic nobis. C. Et ait illis: 4 Si ¡ et illúsit indútum veste alba, et</l><l xml:id="m-fa5f88f0-5f58-4de6-b0c2-86e6b191a1e3" facs="#m-40a06577-a973-4f28-bfc8-9671b1dcc26e" label="lyrics-like">remísit ad Pilátum. Et facti</l><l xml:id="m-29597438-e076-4a07-90b8-a6d3ca133227" facs="#m-2a04f376-02dc-4b58-9c06-22859855149a" label="lyrics-like">vobis díxero, non credétis mihi:</l><l xml:id="m-a4bae0f2-bf15-46d9-897c-d13c1eeb9586" facs="#m-8ee33978-f3e2-4572-a6df-fed54c95dd0b" label="lyrics-like">sunt amíci Heródes et Pilátus</l><l xml:id="m-8b777e08-8213-4043-a87d-4f6065b02656" facs="#m-bf684ca0-6baa-4779-93f5-d0ebb0e22aa9" label="lyrics-like">si autem et interrogávero, non</l><l xml:id="m-31637f20-51fe-48b4-8d1c-e75be200f175" facs="#m-ee51bff4-bda2-458f-b16e-2b60081c69d9" label="lyrics-like">respondébitis mihi, neque dimit¬</l><l xml:id="m-8bc3d355-a579-4e78-b7f1-dabd419735cc" facs="#m-9962a9f6-0197-486e-8989-4bc83d03725a" label="lyrics-like">in ipsa die: nam ántea inimíci</l><l xml:id="m-5c903da0-5512-4cdc-a726-f0b1f294d5eb" facs="#m-debb9585-9b5b-48be-ac27-0b660ef909cb" label="lyrics-like">tétis. Ex hoc autem erit Filius</l><l xml:id="m-9e1780c7-4741-451a-b3be-550852988661" facs="#m-d7e8b190-9ec5-4aa2-a176-cb932ef4a0f9" label="lyrics-like">erant ad invicem. Pilátus autem</l><l xml:id="m-396786e3-d6de-4b88-9b4d-5399e8752f6d" facs="#m-2e891391-8f17-4c13-8c7e-726306788f96" label="lyrics-like">hóminis sedens a dextris vir¬</l><l xml:id="m-b990b9ed-a2f7-4e3a-9a89-347f8c7f9fa7" facs="#m-bfbd0a43-7d9d-4aa0-a295-270e67ab388e" label="lyrics-like">convocátis principibus sacerdó¬</l><l xml:id="m-abacec42-14b7-486d-9570-52b82b23a60a" facs="#m-81d3c104-88c6-421f-93c2-e5990c99cfc2" label="lyrics-like">tútis Dei. C. Dixérunt autem</l><l xml:id="m-4efc9654-6b0e-4f01-9f57-2ee9b5751a8c" facs="#m-3a3693b8-d80a-444f-aedc-a286ab452eef" label="lyrics-like">tum, et magistrátibus, et plebe,</l><l xml:id="m-687c6c45-f51e-4c22-8454-1c9b8bf9b5ec" facs="#m-f7a2b809-2ac4-4894-908a-387eaf5a6236" label="ambiguous">dixit ad illos: S. Obtulistis</l><l xml:id="m-2083cb36-0061-4b7d-96fb-a0e6dfc7ac57" facs="#m-fc0ee1cf-7f9d-4088-961a-e3b4704e79bb" label="ambiguous">omnes: S. Tu ergo es Filius</l><l xml:id="m-14906693-3f58-40ea-ad07-8333f1c2b1be" facs="#m-34142065-775c-45dc-90a8-d71526748e96" label="ambiguous">Dei? C. Qui ait : ★ Vos dicitis</l><l xml:id="m-b7e54e22-7933-4135-acdd-fa2698da8765" facs="#m-d89fdcbd-ce0d-43b7-8997-bd43e627540d" label="lyrics-like">mihi hunc hóminem; quasi aver¬</l><l xml:id="m-b587515e-5889-4bd4-9270-50c43635994e" facs="#m-8b26ab97-f9cc-4b19-88d3-aa995f6f11b9" label="lyrics-like">quia ego sum. C. At illi dixé¬</l><l xml:id="m-42df0e65-bfe5-4462-8241-21a7fe80d908" facs="#m-96df63dd-0d45-488a-b5da-156d7b345a87" label="lyrics-like">téntem pópulum, et ecce ego</l><l xml:id="m-6b12a5aa-b503-42da-8d4d-9af9b0e35c33" facs="#m-16785148-4724-4bd0-9b2b-bd0c100663fe" label="lyrics-like">runt: S. Quid adhuc desiderá¬</l><l xml:id="m-72f2858e-7c04-4f7f-a4a7-109eefb3e2a2" facs="#m-0c266303-3b8f-409b-8df1-4818c34b8c06" label="lyrics-like">coram vobis intérrogans, nullam</l><l xml:id="m-7c4214ef-0665-48fe-a589-3da33725e779" facs="#m-73cb8bfd-2400-451b-b37f-e4ceebd53e1a" label="lyrics-like">causam invéni in hómine isto</l><l xml:id="m-1411f15d-ae58-478f-92e1-fecd7e6d0295" facs="#m-b6a09028-4988-4fe7-9b08-225de353bc10" label="lyrics-like">mus testimónium? Ipsi enim</l><l xml:id="m-ff5b5cc3-63b9-4486-a819-84939d5b5d89" facs="#m-f99d0835-100a-489d-85ec-de0bc89b2657" label="lyrics-like">ex his, in quibus eum accusátis.</l><l xml:id="m-7546ce2e-42c6-4b0e-8724-03ef9a9756fe" facs="#m-ee967567-cd45-4027-b0aa-306b919bf165" label="lyrics-like">audívimus de ore ejus.</l><l xml:id="m-0bde61e5-9dd6-4946-b666-528391e569f6" facs="#m-94c72c4e-ab32-46b7-9bdf-4675c274635c" label="ambiguous">C. Et surgens omnis multi¬</l><l xml:id="m-21c527c6-4db0-4e85-9abd-81e40d3da67c" facs="#m-ec2427a1-9f4e-417d-8c03-a586a641d737" label="lyrics-like">Sed neque Heródes : nam remísi</l><l xml:id="m-9031ef92-16af-48e9-a40b-898d4dedab61" facs="#m-8e1c7c05-433b-4fe4-a3b6-c3f773078e98" label="lyrics-like">túdo eórum, duxérunt illum ad</l><l xml:id="m-41f4e374-62f1-4873-94ac-d3ca438820e8" facs="#m-68d83de7-6efb-48f8-9772-067df662c673" label="ambiguous">vos ad illum, et ecce nihil di¬</l><l xml:id="m-4e51abbc-effd-43c3-bde7-94b47f4f32f9" facs="#m-85a93cdd-bb35-4258-8c5c-b4e724b2ad1b" label="lyrics-like">Pilátum. Cœpérunt autem illum</l><l xml:id="m-ef1b291c-acaa-4fc9-b9a9-61499dcb4ef8" facs="#m-b201cc8a-b89c-4984-8ada-51e769f9c90f" label="ambiguous">gnum morte actum est ei. Emen¬</l><l xml:id="m-929f8604-89b2-41f2-a7ad-95a6c5819a5e" facs="#m-f37789d5-cfdb-445f-a9a5-e346c50a1cbd" label="lyrics-like">accusáre, dicéntes:  Hunc</l><l xml:id="m-5fdc14ac-d1b2-4528-82ff-56ae1d925c08" facs="#m-4f2eb6f0-9cba-463d-be27-4142201ce3d7" label="lyrics-like">dátum ergo illum dimittam.</l><l xml:id="m-1caaab99-9f15-4d9a-8fe9-1bb7bd6f27a0" facs="#m-8826bcaa-c2e1-42f2-85a6-6b0b0d539765" label="lyrics-like">C. Necésse autem habébat</l><l xml:id="m-d9045c3e-f2ff-474a-9200-02bf3259de7b" facs="#m-d6b33e91-b6dd-40eb-8dac-faa822868a95" label="lyrics-like">invénimus subverténtem gentem</l><l xml:id="m-b81547f6-0566-4fc4-81e7-4cda8d697d7f" facs="#m-8a00dde5-cb3f-4a7d-8b9c-48c286e582d1" label="lyrics-like">nostram, et prohibéntem tribúta</l><l xml:id="m-cb823487-84f4-4d50-a17a-b33acc85985b" facs="#m-98fe9222-c46d-45df-bad5-1853fd364adf" label="ambiguous">dimittere eis per diem festum,</l><l xml:id="m-015b9f08-55c0-4a76-b54e-ab4da6d56e5b" facs="#m-29e1918f-8ac8-4d1f-8954-ca22600f6c60" label="lyrics-like">dare Caésarl, et dicéntem se</l><l xml:id="m-954aa4dc-1fc9-4262-a834-ecb71dea7652" facs="#m-e3f3efc5-f619-407c-a15e-82ff2d4d0b20" label="lyrics-like">unum. Exclamávit autem simul</l><l xml:id="m-95d764b4-969e-4a71-89d6-8718a25c3390" facs="#m-65a8f486-30ea-457e-b85c-8003aed56371" label="lyrics-like">Christum regem esse. C. Pilátus</l><l xml:id="m-7e26eb6f-b487-4827-9f10-d11a04d8a2dc" facs="#m-bfae0c82-b569-4bdf-ae95-840d55475c76" label="lyrics-like">univérsa turba, dicens : S. Tolle</l><l xml:id="m-26dce38b-8c18-4253-a7e7-6b59ed18065c" facs="#m-06bf65ca-9acf-4659-9e22-1c1c43c57b78" label="lyrics-like">hunc, et dimitte nobis Baráb¬</l><l xml:id="m-327220ec-c1c7-492d-a8da-55d5fa09500d" facs="#m-ca0ec420-83a6-4a69-8cb7-bec8d6865514" label="lyrics-like">autem interrogávit eum, dicens:</l><l xml:id="m-17bce732-ba7e-45fe-8b97-4896f58a91e0" facs="#m-626d8e8b-8d55-47c9-8c8e-f7e895bcf8a8" label="ambiguous">bam. C. Qui erat propter sedi¬</l><l xml:id="m-ae60eee4-b5dd-4f4b-8114-35c41080d26b" facs="#m-349e9c03-5011-49b9-8e42-754d925663fe" label="lyrics-like">S. Tu es Rex Judacórum? C. At</l><l xml:id="m-b175d37f-655c-4c50-8d3f-b0cf0a141ebe" facs="#m-608ae4f1-7427-4b2b-b319-58d3292ae36b" label="lyrics-like">ille respóndens, ait : — Tu dicis.</l><l xml:id="m-0cb715bd-c683-4033-a671-4d445210052e" facs="#m-8baa395d-1086-4bc5-882f-1d775ab07a27" label="lyrics-like">tiónem quamdam factam in</l><l xml:id="m-b4f66394-40d3-47a8-b954-14b6bcb30f6a" facs="#m-5d22713a-5453-4c4c-afd3-823569965571" label="lyrics-like">C. Ait autem Pilátus ad prin¬</l><l xml:id="m-f55ef738-342d-4528-b3c5-0d843e269497" facs="#m-ee8dfe3f-df05-42f6-81b9-aeff2c7e961e" label="lyrics-like">civitáte, et homicidium, missus</l><l xml:id="m-6e3ce3b9-b5c5-47a0-8885-6f9e48af22fb" facs="#m-381beaa6-7246-4c12-8326-b7333e3b6674" label="lyrics-like">cipes sacerdótum, et turbas</l><l xml:id="m-42b5f842-108e-4a3d-a09c-3aae9596918c" facs="#m-d3ee55c1-464c-4170-9d2a-83025dac217a" label="lyrics-like">in cárcerem. Iterum autem Pilá¬</l><l xml:id="m-54e09af0-a8af-49be-beb4-92ac651d3017" facs="#m-8bc7058a-28b1-4145-bd78-187bc41fa752" label="lyrics-like">S. Nihil invénio causae in hoc</l><l xml:id="m-180c61e2-1071-4308-9376-dd2702352818" facs="#m-fcdb9b26-b0ae-469f-a7da-72928309f4e6" label="lyrics-like">tus locútus est ad eos, volens</l><l xml:id="m-9705b792-73ce-40e5-bb30-7a1e0683bbd8" facs="#m-e5721c0e-df88-426a-8b5b-707eae880bb1" label="lyrics-like">hómine. C. At illi invalescébant,</l><l xml:id="m-384c2643-0121-4146-8258-e70594e9d4a4" facs="#m-f8557b2a-df79-4ce6-a028-358003872437" label="text-like">dimittere Jesum. At illi succla¬</l><l xml:id="m-940c16bf-c658-447c-aa29-533848305870" facs="#m-fec70359-48bf-4ef2-b006-c2feeb1e440f" label="lyrics-like">dicéntes: S. Cómmovet pópu¬</l><l xml:id="m-03ce0899-5262-4411-bd85-ca65f6d57b7c" facs="#m-23362afc-5eb6-45a4-a01d-cd1d8e611430" label="lyrics-like">mábant, dicéntes : S. Crucifige,</l><l xml:id="m-793de256-f7ed-4944-80c3-e89effa1a47b" facs="#m-595013ec-f241-4ca4-9b72-f28ad82bc040" label="lyrics-like">lum, docens per univérsam Ju¬</l><l xml:id="m-8684ae04-acb0-4eb2-8a05-0bd85b61a738" facs="#m-466b3f0b-20e3-4fd1-9211-4c3e100e055d" label="ambiguous">crucifige eum. C. Ille autem</l><l xml:id="m-0141ca4e-1f5b-4b30-b839-5ff6bbf6f5fb" facs="#m-104ceaac-1745-4712-8e07-a6446324975e" label="lyrics-like">daéam, incipiens a Galilaéa usque</l><l xml:id="m-db6ce668-6b79-44a0-b350-9654578aa1e0" facs="#m-8014878b-fb7b-428c-9351-c65ba79fd548" label="lyrics-like">tértio dixit ad illos: S. Quid</l><l xml:id="m-cb520394-376e-40d3-a701-f1b510ead07c" facs="#m-22122ac4-ff05-42a8-ae86-18fe7fe4cce8" label="ambiguous">enim mali fecit iste? Nullam</l><l xml:id="m-5ccd1133-9b22-4f63-aa53-97daf611ed5a" facs="#m-8df1d9f1-4973-455b-84e0-346293934481" label="ambiguous">huc.</l><l xml:id="m-a0c142e3-6e3d-40f7-9564-364e3c4514f8" facs="#m-68a27755-961b-42b1-87d9-389fc0a5e3e6" label="lyrics-like">C. Pilátus autem áudiens Ga¬</l><l xml:id="m-10677376-eba4-4362-976c-b34257189272" facs="#m-0a18d68d-f660-455a-812f-d831ed07b41e" label="lyrics-like">causam mortis invénio in eo:</l><l xml:id="m-0b41e277-b4dd-466f-8e7c-391b4b4d3a36" facs="#m-e2778c75-a742-4edb-b593-b71c159df702" label="lyrics-like">lilaéam, interrogávit si homo</l><l xml:id="m-067f9e13-fdbe-4377-a63a-35ce35000236" facs="#m-8974654a-d810-4ddf-9989-5ed7c49fbaae" label="ambiguous">corripiam ergo illum, et dimit¬</l><l xml:id="m-9b832ead-4ab9-4ec6-b316-7cbca3c46863" facs="#m-31233ba1-594f-465b-aee2-b792aca69083" label="lyrics-like">Galilaéus esset. Et ut cognó¬</l><l xml:id="m-cbe5fb1b-b661-48eb-b09a-cb9efa8ac3e2" facs="#m-8b39e9af-b7e4-4d23-9803-d3efde72def3" label="lyrics-like">tam. C. At illi instábant vócibus</l><l xml:id="m-71f91d85-e901-4a56-b185-4d286ffcbee1" facs="#m-2db8898e-0c1a-4a53-b640-d9971ec0a3bd" label="lyrics-like">vit quod de Heródis potestáte</l><l xml:id="m-8da37f34-d13d-41da-9cce-1a74a522c40f" facs="#m-468557cc-25d0-4470-abae-0526e8edc21d" label="lyrics-like">magnis, postulántes ut cruci¬</l><l xml:id="m-25fca0bc-3f25-48ff-830b-501a82c470ee" facs="#m-f0121b2d-69ca-4c01-b9db-157afa32b9b1" label="lyrics-like">esset, remisit ad Heródem, qui</l><l xml:id="m-36175438-1597-4a09-8860-69fb56d53667" facs="#m-a253411f-71aa-463d-acae-16798b74f054" label="lyrics-like">figerétur. Et invalescébant voces</l><l xml:id="m-9b90ff02-cc47-4f13-9eed-e828e64c10a5" facs="#m-41a01732-e5d2-4b2e-aad9-ff82a8467fc6" label="lyrics-like">eórum. Et Pilátus adjudicávit</l><l xml:id="m-da27ad14-c3d0-43aa-b7b3-513fa556f4ec" facs="#m-ef2cfeb8-497f-427b-bcb7-c28de97f1aca" label="lyrics-like">et ipse Jerosólymis erat illis</l><l xml:id="m-31176e00-009d-4d90-93ae-5d29d5554a84" facs="#m-c4b66cda-e803-4506-b84f-dac48c31612a" label="lyrics-like">diébüs. Heródes autem viso</l><l xml:id="m-387857a0-4d00-45ff-af9b-df73615dd2eb" facs="#m-5e6d803a-9113-4ffc-9257-2e7c22dab982" label="lyrics-like">fieri petitiónem eórum. Dimísit</l><l xml:id="m-64c6a951-88cb-4459-9b2d-3f17d654701a" facs="#m-42b00812-176c-47b5-92e3-1ac988e80061" label="lyrics-like">Jesu, gavísus est valde. Erat</l><l xml:id="m-71f78bd9-6a94-431c-a8cd-5a9722d63d14" facs="#m-eafb1950-ce87-4760-a825-629a8e03a922" label="ambiguous">autem illis eum, qui propter ho¬</l><l xml:id="m-42856227-e745-4a42-a374-b98a5f4f423e" facs="#m-75187341-38d3-4dca-87ad-2e56c761827f" label="lyrics-like">enim cúpiens ex multo témpore</l><l xml:id="m-2a59ebe9-e7ea-4f6c-8841-55a92a20ea47" facs="#m-63c174f7-1ebe-4e0e-8f37-6310da6fc445" label="lyrics-like">micídium et seditiónem missus</l><l xml:id="m-c9f60ad1-0911-4235-bd1e-4ed751e03786" facs="#m-871a6ae0-50c2-4c33-8b45-f654f4567d54" label="lyrics-like">fuerat in cárcerem, quem peté¬</l><l xml:id="m-0f587489-9a97-4a72-ada6-ba3f0ab8f4cc" facs="#m-476709c4-9c5b-4c09-be0b-3d1f4bbaad5d" label="lyrics-like">vidére eum, eo quod audíerat</l><l xml:id="m-20c0dabe-c79d-4166-a28d-81843ca7ec26" facs="#m-5477b74c-61e6-4efa-8423-cb66f66077fd" label="lyrics-like">bant : Jesum vero trádidit vo¬</l><l xml:id="m-165af287-ceea-402a-b66d-31446f84030f" facs="#m-8d068367-e562-4446-834c-b32e57f59431" label="lyrics-like">multa de eo, et sperábat signum</l><l xml:id="m-6ffc2580-f6b3-4566-9a34-00df69d7c18a" facs="#m-93d51856-c0b5-48c0-a29b-995708f9c901" label="lyrics-like">luntáti córum.</l><l xml:id="m-9b2c2ed7-d291-46f3-8560-585e78d93b3f" facs="#m-cd42a934-166b-479e-bf4c-b2e098ef27fb" label="lyrics-like">áliquod vidére ad eo fieri. Inter¬</l><l xml:id="m-7dabff7f-f2eb-4cac-b9bf-ce58c8a4f87d" facs="#m-5b603414-6ea3-4c7e-b75a-bb09ac6784be" label="lyrics-like">rogábat autem eum multis ser¬</l><l xml:id="m-b093b9ce-f339-4a00-bcd0-af31a876d63a" facs="#m-11d98932-f279-42ae-a6dd-aadfdd4faa49" label="lyrics-like">Et cum dúcerent eum, appre¬</l><l xml:id="m-8043c741-474d-4052-80cc-7817d1c2e962" facs="#m-7caa0659-4fd5-4ec5-b2b6-1d13c46a61ff" label="lyrics-like">mónibus. At ipse nihil illi respon¬</l><l xml:id="m-d5cb5687-20c7-4075-a054-e538e65ead2f" facs="#m-d0c48d48-582c-42c6-90be-057b1741f27d" label="lyrics-like">hendérunt Simónem quemdam</l><l xml:id="m-59bee64c-a6a1-48dd-bdcf-5ec46c272ef0" facs="#m-c163efbd-a1d5-4d2a-bb90-d9ebd350e900" label="lyrics-like">débat. Stabant autem principes</l><l xml:id="m-41de6d09-4ffb-44a7-a3dd-eb3a56de7b2b" facs="#m-35863197-b584-4655-a74d-8b278536dc2c" label="lyrics-like">Cyrenénsem, veniéntem de vil¬</l><l xml:id="m-ef8d61fb-b40e-4cc3-81bc-8ec2c1797ec4" facs="#m-0e6a4b34-ecf3-44e2-9959-06114fcb4fda" label="lyrics-like">la: et imposuérunt illi crucem</l><l xml:id="m-4c7fc9fb-21bf-44aa-9567-dab038fd9ac8" facs="#m-df95ada7-63bb-44da-90ec-b0507a19684b" label="lyrics-like">sacerdótum, et scribae constánter</l><l xml:id="m-f1df803a-9669-4923-ad03-c82541e74aba" facs="#m-ba3fc2c1-e1a4-425e-90de-c505722d3761" label="lyrics-like">portáre post Jesum. Sequebátur</l><l xml:id="m-e95697ed-b0f9-4f98-9c1b-55470f71ad24" facs="#m-2a0bddf3-b3b7-470a-a44e-a424672d4b62" label="lyrics-like">accusántes eum. Sprevit autem</l><l xml:id="m-9a615cef-47ae-4241-ab69-2f0c22fd6218" facs="#m-380e758a-27fd-4aa7-ba3b-910ae2d7e239" label="lyrics-like">illum Heródes cum exércitu suo:</l><l xml:id="m-b12b19a0-14d4-4471-80d7-1be82e40b458" facs="#m-0424d1e1-5c1e-411a-8397-3050bb564f0d" label="lyrics-like">autem illum multa turba pópuli,</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>